2117
00:03:15,047 --> 00:03:18,967
meditation    homecoming

2118
00:03:54,217 --> 00:03:58,047
It is senseless to involve oneself with an escapee.

2119
00:03:58,047 --> 00:04:01,807
However, I believe it is only natural

2120
00:04:01,807 --> 00:04:03,677
that deviants of Romdeau be punished.

2121
00:04:03,677 --> 00:04:05,267
A generalization.

2122
00:04:05,267 --> 00:04:09,817
Preaching generalizations is for
 those who do not practice business.

2123
00:04:10,107 --> 00:04:14,067
Be mindful of the fact that you
 are the Citizen Security Bureau Chief.

2124
00:04:14,067 --> 00:04:14,817
Understood.

2125
00:04:14,817 --> 00:04:17,317
Blood pressure and pulse rate are both increasing.

2126
00:04:17,617 --> 00:04:19,577
Respiratory rate changing.

2127
00:04:20,367 --> 00:04:21,947
Are you analyzing me?

2128
00:04:21,947 --> 00:04:25,957
What is the point in analyzing a
 human who is under emotional control?

2129
00:04:25,957 --> 00:04:29,037
That arrogance invites error.

2130
00:04:35,377 --> 00:04:36,717
Are you all right,

2131
00:04:36,717 --> 00:04:37,797
Sir?

2132
00:04:47,137 --> 00:04:49,477
What a vile face.

2133
00:04:59,357 --> 00:05:01,827
It is something...

2134
00:05:02,367 --> 00:05:03,577
that taints me.

2135
00:05:14,667 --> 00:05:16,127
Daedalus!

2136
00:05:48,617 --> 00:05:50,327
I'm cold...

2137
00:05:50,327 --> 00:05:54,667
The high fever will cause your skin and blood vessels to contract,

2138
00:05:54,667 --> 00:05:56,667
resulting in chills and spasms,

2139
00:05:56,667 --> 00:05:58,757
eventually leading to death.

2140
00:06:04,257 --> 00:06:05,507
Where's Vincent?!

2141
00:06:05,967 --> 00:06:07,267
Where is he?!

2142
00:06:08,097 --> 00:06:09,307
Is he already-

2143
00:06:09,307 --> 00:06:10,187
No.

2144
00:06:10,187 --> 00:06:12,307
He hasn't left yet.

2145
00:06:12,307 --> 00:06:14,517
But tomorrow he'll probably...

2146
00:06:14,517 --> 00:06:15,607
Dammit.

2147
00:06:16,227 --> 00:06:19,357
In your condition, you shouldn't overexert yourself.

2148
00:06:25,447 --> 00:06:26,827
Vincent Law...

2149
00:06:27,827 --> 00:06:30,787
the only clue that could help me solve the mystery of PROXY.

2150
00:06:41,547 --> 00:06:42,547
Dammit.

2151
00:06:42,877 --> 00:06:45,547
Dang, it won't even make a single sound.

2152
00:06:45,547 --> 00:06:47,887
It's the newest model from Romdeau all right.

2153
00:06:47,887 --> 00:06:50,057
It's snobby.

2154
00:06:51,847 --> 00:06:53,847
Oh, we were just looking for you.

2155
00:06:53,847 --> 00:06:56,227
You're good with machines, aren't you?

2156
00:06:56,227 --> 00:06:58,067
How do you-

2157
00:06:56,897 --> 00:06:58,067
Why do you have this?

2158
00:06:58,817 --> 00:07:00,317
Did you steal it?

2159
00:07:00,317 --> 00:07:02,567
"Steal"?

2160
00:07:03,027 --> 00:07:05,907
It wasn't Hoody's in the first place.

2161
00:07:06,317 --> 00:07:07,577
Quinn said

2162
00:07:07,867 --> 00:07:10,867
that she's going to use this to lure that negotiator here.

2163
00:07:10,867 --> 00:07:12,117
What?

2164
00:07:12,117 --> 00:07:17,787
That woman's gone a bit crazy ever since Timothy died.

2165
00:07:17,787 --> 00:07:20,047
Well, we have too.

2166
00:07:31,927 --> 00:07:32,927
What?

2167
00:07:33,477 --> 00:07:35,637
Where is Vincent Law?

2168
00:07:35,637 --> 00:07:36,767
Who knows.

2169
00:07:37,897 --> 00:07:41,147
You're the one who stole my AHT, aren't you?

2170
00:07:42,357 --> 00:07:44,027
Would you like me to give it back?

2171
00:07:46,277 --> 00:07:49,827
I'm going to take that man back with me to Romdeau.

2172
00:07:50,487 --> 00:07:52,447
I won't let him go with you.

2173
00:07:52,447 --> 00:07:54,117
Take him back on that?

2174
00:07:54,707 --> 00:07:57,077
Choose the man or the vehicle.

2175
00:07:58,667 --> 00:08:01,207
You're pathetic, Princess.

2176
00:08:06,337 --> 00:08:07,427
Miss Re-l!

2177
00:08:10,797 --> 00:08:12,597
Vin... cent!

2178
00:08:17,637 --> 00:08:18,937
Miss Re-l!

2179
00:08:19,437 --> 00:08:22,017
Hoody doesn't have the vaccine.

2180
00:08:22,477 --> 00:08:23,647
It ran out

2181
00:08:23,647 --> 00:08:25,317
a long time ago.

2182
00:08:26,027 --> 00:08:28,567
He's hidden that fact from the folks here, though.

2183
00:08:28,567 --> 00:08:31,367
But my illness. He...

2184
00:08:31,367 --> 00:08:33,157
Treated it, he said?

2185
00:08:33,157 --> 00:08:34,537
That's a lie.

2186
00:08:34,537 --> 00:08:36,867
You recovered on your own.

2187
00:08:36,867 --> 00:08:38,367
There's no... medicine?

2188
00:08:38,367 --> 00:08:39,367
There's no... medicine?

2189
00:08:39,957 --> 00:08:40,957
But...

2190
00:08:42,207 --> 00:08:43,297
That's...

2191
00:08:43,627 --> 00:08:45,377
The last one.

2192
00:08:45,377 --> 00:08:47,417
But I can't just give it to you for free.

2193
00:08:48,047 --> 00:08:49,427
If you'll bring that girl

2194
00:08:50,047 --> 00:08:52,967
to the rabbit, I'll give this to you.

2195
00:08:53,297 --> 00:08:55,217
Don't frown.

2196
00:08:55,217 --> 00:08:57,387
She'll recover as long as she gets this.

2197
00:08:57,977 --> 00:08:59,807
The more the merrier, you know...

2198
00:09:00,477 --> 00:09:01,477
when you travel.

2199
00:09:10,857 --> 00:09:12,027
Hoody.

2200
00:09:12,027 --> 00:09:13,067
Ah, Pino.

2201
00:09:13,737 --> 00:09:15,287
What are you doing?

2202
00:09:15,287 --> 00:09:17,327
Nothing...

2203
00:09:17,327 --> 00:09:18,577
nothing at all.

2204
00:09:19,957 --> 00:09:23,457
You're leaving this place tomorrow, aren't you.

2205
00:09:23,457 --> 00:09:24,667
That's right.

2206
00:09:25,457 --> 00:09:27,917
You don't want to go back to Romdeau?

2207
00:09:28,257 --> 00:09:29,717
Not really.

2208
00:09:29,717 --> 00:09:30,677
Why not?

2209
00:09:31,127 --> 00:09:33,927
Well, I can't leave Vince alone.

2210
00:09:34,507 --> 00:09:36,217
Oh, but Pa-

2211
00:09:40,057 --> 00:09:42,397
No, it's nothing.

2212
00:09:43,557 --> 00:09:44,937
Hey, Hoody.

2213
00:09:46,107 --> 00:09:47,727
Do you know where Timothy is?

2214
00:09:48,227 --> 00:09:51,527
I've been looking for him, but I can't find him anywhere.

2215
00:09:52,697 --> 00:09:55,697
Timothy died, didn't he?

2216
00:09:55,987 --> 00:09:57,577
Yeah, that's right.

2217
00:09:57,577 --> 00:10:00,657
So, I was wondering if there was another Timothy.

2218
00:10:00,657 --> 00:10:01,707
Pino...

2219
00:10:03,707 --> 00:10:08,547
When people die, you can never see them ever again.

2220
00:10:09,007 --> 00:10:09,707
What?

2221
00:10:09,707 --> 00:10:10,967
Really?

2222
00:10:12,007 --> 00:10:13,547
Really.

2223
00:10:14,007 --> 00:10:15,257
Really...

2224
00:10:15,717 --> 00:10:18,387
I wish I could've played with him more.

2225
00:10:20,177 --> 00:10:22,267
Are you lonely, Pino?

2226
00:10:22,267 --> 00:10:23,887
"Lonely"?

2227
00:10:24,347 --> 00:10:25,597
Yes.

2228
00:10:25,597 --> 00:10:27,857
Right now, the feeling you have right there

2229
00:10:28,147 --> 00:10:30,817
is loneliness.

2230
00:10:37,197 --> 00:10:38,777
"Loneliness"...

2231
00:10:39,617 --> 00:10:40,487
Damn.

2232
00:10:40,487 --> 00:10:43,117
And we managed to lure the girl over, too.

2233
00:10:43,407 --> 00:10:45,037
Be patient.

2234
00:10:45,037 --> 00:10:47,917
We still have the girl's vehicle.

2235
00:10:48,537 --> 00:10:51,257
Besides, we're better off not angering that man.

2236
00:10:51,257 --> 00:10:53,507
What? That's not like you.

2237
00:10:54,257 --> 00:10:56,637
You 'fraid of that sprout?

2238
00:10:57,177 --> 00:10:59,257
Who knows? I wonder myself.

2239
00:10:59,507 --> 00:11:01,677
I brought them, Quinn.

2240
00:11:04,477 --> 00:11:05,937
Wow.

2241
00:11:05,937 --> 00:11:07,147
What are these?

2242
00:11:07,147 --> 00:11:08,437
So many...

2243
00:11:09,817 --> 00:11:11,477
I have sown the seed.

2244
00:11:11,477 --> 00:11:13,987
Now we'll see how he responds.

2245
00:11:16,317 --> 00:11:17,857
I'll take you with me.

2246
00:11:19,867 --> 00:11:21,537
I have no other choice!

2247
00:11:21,537 --> 00:11:22,617
Vince?

2248
00:11:27,247 --> 00:11:29,377
You intend to take the girl?

2249
00:11:30,667 --> 00:11:33,457
Even if she stays here, she won't be cured of the infection.

2250
00:11:33,457 --> 00:11:34,967
Vincent, what are you say-

2251
00:11:34,967 --> 00:11:38,007
<i>You </i>know that better than anyone!

2252
00:11:39,467 --> 00:11:40,847
You knew?

2253
00:11:41,137 --> 00:11:44,177
If we get on that ship, we can get the vaccine.

2254
00:11:44,177 --> 00:11:47,017
You're saying that Quinn will save that girl?

2255
00:11:47,597 --> 00:11:48,647
Fool!

2256
00:11:49,147 --> 00:11:52,147
She's of Romdeau - they took Timothy's life.

2257
00:11:53,567 --> 00:11:58,067
Once you take off on the rabbit, the dome will pursue you for sure.

2258
00:11:58,657 --> 00:12:02,197
If you use that girl as a shield, they won't be able to attack.

2259
00:12:02,197 --> 00:12:04,077
But once you make it through the bay

2260
00:12:04,077 --> 00:12:07,327
and shake off your pursuers, she'll have outlived her usefulness.

2261
00:12:07,957 --> 00:12:10,287
Quinn's promise to help her is a lie.

2262
00:12:10,997 --> 00:12:13,417
You'd be a fool to believe her.

2263
00:12:13,417 --> 00:12:15,417
But if there's a vaccine-

2264
00:12:16,967 --> 00:12:19,757
That vaccine was fake.

2265
00:12:21,047 --> 00:12:24,847
Even if it were real, in the extreme cold outside...

2266
00:12:25,307 --> 00:12:28,137
In her weakened state...

2267
00:12:28,727 --> 00:12:31,097
Even so, if things go on like this...

2268
00:12:31,097 --> 00:12:31,977
Yes.

2269
00:12:31,977 --> 00:12:33,607
She won't last much longer.

2270
00:12:34,147 --> 00:12:35,977
Then what are you saying I should do?!

2271
00:12:36,477 --> 00:12:38,527
Return her to Romdeau.

2272
00:12:39,357 --> 00:12:40,987
Return her... to Romdeau?

2273
00:12:40,987 --> 00:12:42,027
Return her... to Romdeau?

2274
00:12:42,527 --> 00:12:44,197
If you don't want her to die,

2275
00:12:44,197 --> 00:12:46,657
you have no choice but to return her to Romdeau.

2276
00:12:46,657 --> 00:12:49,287
I don't know what you did in the dome,

2277
00:12:49,287 --> 00:12:52,167
but that girl came to take you back.

2278
00:12:52,167 --> 00:12:55,037
You're someone special - someone who can go back.

2279
00:12:55,377 --> 00:12:57,667
Those of Romdeau go back to Romdeau.

2280
00:12:57,667 --> 00:12:59,587
It's the way of things.

2281
00:13:00,297 --> 00:13:02,047
If you rebel against it, you will rot away.

2282
00:13:04,047 --> 00:13:05,467
Return... to Romdeau.

2283
00:13:05,467 --> 00:13:06,557
Return... to Romdeau.

2284
00:13:11,267 --> 00:13:12,557
Quinn.

2285
00:13:12,557 --> 00:13:13,937
Come here.

2286
00:13:14,397 --> 00:13:15,607
Quinn!

2287
00:13:18,607 --> 00:13:20,527
He's thinking of going back to Romdeau?

2288
00:13:32,707 --> 00:13:33,997
Take this.

2289
00:13:36,377 --> 00:13:37,957
Take care of yourself.

2290
00:13:37,957 --> 00:13:39,127
You too.

2291
00:13:45,797 --> 00:13:48,887
You're going back to Romdeau, Miss Re-l.

2292
00:13:56,557 --> 00:13:57,357
Hop, hop, hop...

2293
00:13:57,357 --> 00:13:58,067
Hop, hop, hop...

2294
00:13:58,067 --> 00:13:58,647
Hop, hop, hop...

2295
00:13:58,647 --> 00:13:59,437
Hop, hop!

2296
00:13:59,437 --> 00:14:00,727
Hop, hop!

2297
00:14:08,117 --> 00:14:09,407
Plane!

2298
00:14:11,247 --> 00:14:12,497
We're leaving!

2299
00:14:22,087 --> 00:14:23,127
Pino...

2300
00:14:25,427 --> 00:14:26,887
Bye bye...

2301
00:14:39,817 --> 00:14:41,357
Re-l Mayer, you said?

2302
00:14:41,647 --> 00:14:46,107
An AHT is currently docked outside of Plugvent 3.

2303
00:14:46,657 --> 00:14:48,367
Regarding its reentry, the Administrative Bureau is-

2304
00:14:48,367 --> 00:14:49,987
Now of all times...

2305
00:14:51,117 --> 00:14:52,367
Chief.

2306
00:14:52,907 --> 00:14:54,447
Let it wait.

2307
00:14:55,157 --> 00:14:59,077
It's only natural to disallow the return of
 those who leave the dome without permission

2308
00:14:59,077 --> 00:15:04,707
and punish those who leave and become deviants.

2309
00:15:05,587 --> 00:15:07,377
It's a generalization indeed.

2310
00:15:09,337 --> 00:15:10,387
No,

2311
00:15:10,757 --> 00:15:13,217
it is why one must be absolute.

2312
00:15:13,217 --> 00:15:15,347
Isn't that right, Kristeva?

2313
00:15:19,897 --> 00:15:21,357
There are no waves.

2314
00:15:23,897 --> 00:15:25,147
Well?

2315
00:15:25,147 --> 00:15:27,777
Nothing. I'm clueless about machines.

2316
00:15:27,777 --> 00:15:29,817
It'd better not sink.

2317
00:15:29,817 --> 00:15:32,577
If I were to commit suicide with someone, I'd pick a better man.

2318
00:15:32,577 --> 00:15:33,657
True 'nuff.

2319
00:15:34,117 --> 00:15:34,867
Stupid.

2320
00:15:34,867 --> 00:15:36,157
She's talking about you.

2321
00:15:36,157 --> 00:15:37,407
Whaaat?

2322
00:15:37,407 --> 00:15:38,497
In any case,

2323
00:15:38,497 --> 00:15:40,287
reconnect the severed lines.

2324
00:15:40,787 --> 00:15:42,377
It can just be a temporary fix.

2325
00:15:42,377 --> 00:15:43,917
But Quinn...

2326
00:15:46,207 --> 00:15:47,337
It's quiet.

2327
00:15:47,337 --> 00:15:48,967
Is it because there's no wind?

2328
00:15:48,967 --> 00:15:49,717
No...

2329
00:15:49,717 --> 00:15:51,177
Not just because there's no wind.

2330
00:15:51,177 --> 00:15:54,347
Quinn, are a lot of scary things coming?

2331
00:15:55,767 --> 00:15:57,267
Don't worry.

2332
00:15:57,267 --> 00:15:59,437
You're like Papa, Quinn.

2333
00:15:59,437 --> 00:16:02,307
Hey, you mean "Mama", don't you?

2334
00:16:04,067 --> 00:16:05,687
I don't really understand.

2335
00:16:26,837 --> 00:16:27,417
Dammit.

2336
00:16:27,417 --> 00:16:28,587
Not here.

2337
00:16:28,587 --> 00:16:29,337
Hurry up!

2338
00:16:29,337 --> 00:16:30,667
Or you'll be full of holes!

2339
00:16:37,467 --> 00:16:38,597
Anything from Chief Raul?

2340
00:16:38,597 --> 00:16:39,727
Not yet.

2341
00:16:39,727 --> 00:16:40,937
Useless.

2342
00:16:40,937 --> 00:16:43,307
As we suspected, Re-l Mayer's infection is-

2343
00:16:43,897 --> 00:16:45,807
That's a headache.

2344
00:16:46,477 --> 00:16:49,107
Her passenger, who has identified himself as Vincent Law,

2345
00:16:49,107 --> 00:16:51,697
was previously wanted by the Security Bureau.

2346
00:16:51,697 --> 00:16:53,027
Shall we report him?

2347
00:16:53,487 --> 00:16:55,487
She brought him back.

2348
00:16:55,487 --> 00:16:57,117
He's worth a look.

2349
00:16:57,657 --> 00:17:00,037
Just report that there was a passenger.

2350
00:17:00,037 --> 00:17:03,867
We can say we didn't know he was Vincent.

2351
00:17:03,867 --> 00:17:04,917
Sir?

2352
00:17:04,917 --> 00:17:06,037
You think it's a bad idea?

2353
00:17:06,877 --> 00:17:10,047
However, I am not so kind as to show cards

2354
00:17:10,047 --> 00:17:11,547
I am not required to disclose.

2355
00:17:14,047 --> 00:17:14,887
Damn! Damn! Damn!

2356
00:17:14,887 --> 00:17:15,337
Damn! Damn! Damn!

2357
00:17:15,337 --> 00:17:16,047
Damn! Damn! Damn!

2358
00:17:16,887 --> 00:17:18,467
Report, Hokim!

2359
00:17:18,467 --> 00:17:18,927
Damn! Damn!

2360
00:17:18,927 --> 00:17:19,597
Damn! Damn!

2361
00:17:24,097 --> 00:17:25,687
Stay down, Pino!

2362
00:17:53,217 --> 00:17:54,507
Chief Raul.

2363
00:17:55,007 --> 00:17:56,337
It was just getting good, too.

2364
00:17:56,797 --> 00:18:00,597
I am sure you have received our
 request for the release of Plugvent 3.

2365
00:18:00,597 --> 00:18:02,967
The outside air is full of pathogens.

2366
00:18:02,967 --> 00:18:05,057
Considering the additional fact that she is infected,

2367
00:18:05,057 --> 00:18:07,307
I cannot approve the release that easily.

2368
00:18:07,307 --> 00:18:09,607
I believe we've given you enough time to consider,

2369
00:18:09,607 --> 00:18:11,107
Security Bureau Chief.

2370
00:18:12,727 --> 00:18:15,147
We've taken all the necessary precautions.

2371
00:18:15,147 --> 00:18:16,487
Please approve the release.

2372
00:18:17,987 --> 00:18:19,277
I have no choice.

2373
00:18:19,277 --> 00:18:23,117
We shall deal with her passenger as well.

2374
00:18:24,157 --> 00:18:25,407
Passenger?

2375
00:18:26,327 --> 00:18:28,327
It's not just that upstart girl?

2376
00:18:30,127 --> 00:18:31,627
Vincent Law...

2377
00:18:33,627 --> 00:18:37,677
Leave three of the pursuit units
 and have the rest go to Plugvent 3.

2378
00:18:38,837 --> 00:18:39,887
I will go there as well.

2379
00:18:40,257 --> 00:18:41,217
Yes, sir.

2380
00:18:42,717 --> 00:18:44,137
He's there.

2381
00:18:44,767 --> 00:18:46,227
He's not on the wing ship.

2382
00:18:52,727 --> 00:18:54,477
What's going on?

2383
00:18:54,977 --> 00:18:55,737
There.

2384
00:18:56,647 --> 00:18:57,737
In any case, this is our chance.

2385
00:18:58,027 --> 00:18:59,237
Get it fixed!

2386
00:18:59,607 --> 00:19:01,867
That's strange...

2387
00:19:01,867 --> 00:19:04,907
I haven't heard the name of this passenger.

2388
00:19:04,907 --> 00:19:07,157
Why do you think it's him?

2389
00:19:07,157 --> 00:19:08,657
That's just a guess, no?

2390
00:19:08,957 --> 00:19:10,957
However, the possibility of it being true is high.

2391
00:19:11,417 --> 00:19:13,037
Vincent Law...

2392
00:19:13,037 --> 00:19:15,587
Charged with treason for destroying an Entourage.

2393
00:19:16,047 --> 00:19:17,417
He's just an immigrant.

2394
00:19:17,417 --> 00:19:19,297
He may be dissentious,

2395
00:19:19,297 --> 00:19:22,847
but he doesn't seem to warrant a
 full-fledged pursuit by the Security Bureau.

2396
00:19:22,847 --> 00:19:25,257
As I said, it just goes to show we shouldn't be bothered

2397
00:19:25,257 --> 00:19:27,677
by such an unremarkable man more than we have to be.

2398
00:19:30,137 --> 00:19:31,097
Excuse me.

2399
00:19:31,097 --> 00:19:33,187
It's just that you seem rather obsessed.

2400
00:19:33,727 --> 00:19:38,027
Re-l Mayer is on the other side of the hatch, Chairman Daedalus.

2401
00:19:38,027 --> 00:19:40,197
It would be best that you not forget that fact.

2402
00:20:05,967 --> 00:20:07,257
All right, I understand.

2403
00:20:07,257 --> 00:20:09,217
The passenger, Vincent Law,

2404
00:20:09,217 --> 00:20:12,097
will be executed immediately upon identity confirmation.

2405
00:20:12,097 --> 00:20:13,597
Can't be helped.

2406
00:20:13,597 --> 00:20:16,057
Re-l is our highest priority right now.

2407
00:20:16,057 --> 00:20:19,897
Tell them that they will regret it if they harm Re-l in any way.

2408
00:20:21,527 --> 00:20:23,027
Releasing plugvent.

2409
00:20:23,527 --> 00:20:24,867
Do we have your permission, sir?

2410
00:20:25,237 --> 00:20:25,987
Yes.

2411
00:20:26,867 --> 00:20:27,697
Go ahead.

2412
00:20:28,697 --> 00:20:30,077
Releasing hatch.

2413
00:20:46,677 --> 00:20:49,887
Show your face, Vincent.

2414
00:21:10,657 --> 00:21:11,367
We did it!

2415
00:21:11,367 --> 00:21:12,117
It moved!

2416
00:21:12,577 --> 00:21:13,997
It's moving!

2417
00:21:14,407 --> 00:21:16,327
Good job, kid.

2418
00:21:51,827 --> 00:21:53,447
This is how it should be.

2419
00:22:11,297 --> 00:22:12,557
Quinn!

2420
00:22:33,327 --> 00:22:35,117
The wing ship has left the bay.

2421
00:22:35,747 --> 00:22:39,117
The surveillance units will not be able to engage in further pursuit.

2422
00:22:39,117 --> 00:22:42,127
Burn the Commune to the ground!

2423
00:22:44,497 --> 00:22:45,627
Miss Quinn...

2424
00:22:47,167 --> 00:22:48,297
This...

2425
00:22:48,297 --> 00:22:49,627
Liquor.

2426
00:22:49,627 --> 00:22:51,087
The really good kind.

2427
00:22:51,087 --> 00:22:52,337
Be thankful...

2428
00:22:52,337 --> 00:22:53,347
when you drink it.

2429
00:22:53,967 --> 00:22:55,927
We can still go back to the Commune.

2430
00:22:55,927 --> 00:22:57,217
Let's go back and treat your injuries!

2431
00:22:57,217 --> 00:22:58,137
Quinn!

2432
00:22:57,557 --> 00:22:58,137
Quinn...

2433
00:22:58,677 --> 00:23:00,137
Jeez,

2434
00:23:00,477 --> 00:23:02,267
listen to yourselves.

2435
00:23:06,317 --> 00:23:07,227
Look.

2436
00:23:08,237 --> 00:23:11,067
They're acting lost because they can't come over here.

2437
00:23:11,067 --> 00:23:13,777
To think that we were all so scared of those stupid things...

2438
00:23:14,827 --> 00:23:16,407
What a joke.

2439
00:23:18,247 --> 00:23:20,367
Serves them right.

2440
00:23:20,367 --> 00:23:22,577
Every last one of them...

2441
00:23:24,877 --> 00:23:25,417
Quinn!

2442
00:23:25,417 --> 00:23:26,247
Quinn...

2443
00:23:26,247 --> 00:23:27,497
Quinn...?

2444
00:23:35,597 --> 00:23:36,427
I'm...

2445
00:23:37,557 --> 00:23:40,427
lonely, Quinn.

